## 🚀 **Quick Start**

### **Initialize Repository**

```bash
repo init -u https://github.com/LightningOS-AOSP/manifest -b 1.1 --git-lfs
```

### **Sync Sources**

```bash
repo sync -c --force-sync --optimized-fetch --no-tags --no-clone-bundle --prune -j$(nproc --all)
```

### **Build LightningOS**

```bash
# Setup environment
. build/envsetup.sh

# Initialize build for your device
strike <devicecodename> user | userdebug

# Start building
lightning b
```

---

## ⚙️ **Configuration Flags**

### **Essential Flags**

| Flag                        | Description                    | Values           |
| --------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------- |
| `LIGHTNINGOS_MAINTAINER :=` | Set maintainer name            | `"Your Name"`    |
| `WITH_GMS :=`               | Include Google Mobile Services | `true` / `false` |

### **GMS Variants** _(Optional)_

| Flag                        | Description               | Default |
| --------------------------- | ------------------------- | ------- |
| `TARGET_USES_MINI_GAPPS :=` | Use minimal GApps package | `false` |
| `TARGET_USES_PICO_GAPPS :=` | Use pico GApps package    | `false` |

> 💡 **Note**: Default configuration includes Full GMS package

## 📝 **Build Example**

```makefile
# In your device.mk or BoardConfig.mk

# Set maintainer
LIGHTNINGOS_MAINTAINER := "John Doe"

# Enable GMS with mini package
WITH_GMS := true
TARGET_USES_MINI_GAPPS := true
```

